msgid ""
"These filters all focus on reducing the blur in the image by sharpening and en"
"hancing details and the edges. Following are various sharpen and enhance filte"
"rs in provided in Krita."
msgstr ""
"Estes filtros céntranse todos en reducir o desenfoque da imaxe focalizándoa e "
"mellorando os detalles e os bordos. A continuación lístanse algúns filtros de "
"focalización e mellora incluídos en Krita."

